# Require the repo owner's review on changes to the security gate's own
# definition — the workflows that run it, the driver scripts, and the
# reviewer's skills. Paired with branch protection's "require review from
# Code Owners", this closes the gap where a pull_request could edit its own
# check (the workflow file runs from the PR head) to pass without a real
# review. Last matching pattern wins, so the specific paths below override
# the global owner.
